# The one-off scripts above stay out of the repo, but run-all.ps1 is tracked and calls
# these two on every pipeline run — a clone without them cannot export or import at all.
# Neither carries a credential: the export uses Windows auth, the import reads DATABASE_URL.
!export-all.ps1
!import-all-safe.js
